REQUIRE VERSION "1.15"
INCLUDE life_cell

# ATOMIC PRINTER LIFE_FORCE MI2350: UGCG after SMS1 on plasma-membrane sphingomyelin limb.
# Continuum ...->soat1->nceh1->abca1->abcg1->lcat->cetp->pltp->scarb1->npc1l1->npc2->npc1->stard3->osbp->sacm1l->cert->sms1->ugcg (UGCG after SMS1 PM SM limb)
# Gift: UGCG synthesizes SM at the plasma membrane under ASSERT after SMS1 Golgi ward.
# Domain: post-SMS1 plasma-membrane UGCG/SGMS2 sphingomyelin synthase ward (PM SM limb).
# Cube is SoT. Free energy must flow. Not a dual ladder.

ENTITY press OF Cell 1 60 0
ENTITY ink OF Cell 1 40 0
ENTITY dead OF Cell 0 10 0

